{"posts":[{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1126","t":"full wrote: hi guys!!very few trade at the moment,because i'am very busy at work.\n\nThat was a really nice catch\n\nkeep it up mate","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1126","p":46,"im":["a3e3436b62ca4e5c6f7b433e4dfcf0a4277a261d"],"m":1126},{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1127","t":"Goodmorning all. Take a look to DAX M1 for a QM. This is my view on M15 supply:\n\nand this is what I catch on M1 chart.... the circled level was the one I was looking for reaction but price turned at lower price.\n\nWhat am I viewing wrong? Update will follow Thanks for your point of view","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#1127","p":46,"im":[],"m":1127},{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1128","t":"Al3cs wrote: Goodmorning all. Take a look to DAX M1 for a QM. This is my view on M15 supply:\n\nLooks good... where's the target?","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#1128","p":46,"im":[],"m":1128},{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1129","t":"Al3cs wrote:\n\nAl3cs wrote: Goodmorning all. Take a look to DAX M1 for a QM. This is my view on M15 supply:\n\nAn happy end. I'll put this on my journal too. Thanks for your attention:)","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#1129","p":46,"im":[],"m":1129},{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1130","t":"QM examples and trades\n\nQM over the Time","a":"Ahmadhassan745","d":"","n":"#1130","p":46,"im":["5d76b5f5d16e92643481c5f39ae6ca23d2ceb780","4e0bcc543fb787ca046af65ffde43fe4cd61a26b","c30a78fdb634cb1dd8d26ee2998d31fd30aee7f1","0d7033773733b3f8efccbe0a9eb606ca6d11e983","59b244c3808e0670941da0bc7700bd9aa4401359","f59f275ba56a5f4dc3ce227f8881163108f18f68"],"m":1130},{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1131","t":"Away\n\nHello everyone. This is the first time I post some charts. I would like to thank IF and all other for the fantastic education available here. Three months ago I was still plotting MAs and macds. Yesterday I was trying to make sense from my boxes, zones etc when suddenly I realised that I had a beautiful QM happening just in front of my nose. It was the first time I saw one live. It's terrifying. I initially took screenshots of the differents stages of the move but It was too messy so I will put only the first one and then the whole move in cleaner charts. What I took from this: For a QM to be valid you want: -an EG of a FL/ftr from a pole into consolidation. -a FO of the consolidation ( which is in fact the filling of the HTF SD) -a second engulf of your FL back into the pole as confirmation. -Then you wait at QM level. -If you miss it or are not filled you have a second chance because the price will pull back at the level of the initial FL. I understand the reference to the hunchback Quasimodo from the book but personally would have named it Hannibal the Cannibal... Or Jack the Ripper\n\nI am not sure of all this so help and comments are welcome! Have a great week end.","a":"corsica","d":"","n":"#1131","p":46,"im":["d234d7fc4ca5c172b959b4ef2113431bbf351cf3","1385e50a6428e721e593cee1a8c49209688e8e6e","63c92cd65bcb03b746b18618ad73468dea7c6a90"],"m":1131},{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1132","t":"This is a nice QM. This trade is good but the picture is much better. IF signature Thank you my friend!","a":"mertch","d":"","n":"#1132","p":46,"im":["c027b38b9699d7037297edc45f2ba82c9a37f943","b4fce54164dd3dddfc2775adbf36d146670ecde1"],"m":1132},{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1133","t":"Not bad","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#1133","p":46,"im":[],"fa":"بد نبود","m":1133},{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1134","t":"Goodmorning all, well I know this could be too much for me but I'm a dreamer so, I was playing out with charts and I have to ask you, what do you think about this monster potential QM on GJ?","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#1134","p":46,"im":[],"m":1134},{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1135","t":"Without history hard to say... Also because of this:","a":"Jurij","d":"","n":"#1135","p":46,"im":["7ea28549ceda51036aa2e710f471229f06c417c1"],"m":1135},{"id":"quasimodo_p46_1136","t":"this is my first post on QMs any comments are welcome\n\nGUNNER","a":"pmbGUNNER","d":"","n":"#1136","p":46,"im":["143770b51df09e5e9798dadc3a4d39